{r}More{r} research{r} is{g} still{g} needed{r} on{r} the{r} effect{r} of{r} individual{r} exercises{r} and{r} how{r} and{r} why{r} they{r} may{r} decrease{r} risk{r} of{r} or{r} prevent{r} sports{r} injuries{r}.{r}
