CPEC Cultural Caravan Festival, Artists Convention and the closing ceremony of the 9th National Art Exhibition would leave a significant cultural impact at home and abroad. Director General of The Pakistan National council of the Arts (PNCA) Jamal Shah said this here Thursday while speaking at the media meet the PNCA organised to brief the journalists about the upcoming mega events.
